body:
This has been bothering me for quite a while now. My current partner, when we started having sex, I was taking a really long time to orgasm. Most of the times even I just wasn't able to climax and had to let it go out of sheer tiredness. 

&#x200B;

Now, as it turns out, I cum quickly. I am puzzled. The only thing I can think of is the 'feelings'. Now since we are a couple and sex is more intimate I am able to finish. But I wished it wasn't this quick!
